DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
16006::$$$message_0125_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, it's Emiya."[lr]::
16007::$$$message_0125_0000_0001$$$::"Well, if it isn't Emiya."[lr]::
16008::$$$message_0125_0000_0002$$$::"Guh, Emiya..."[lr]::
16009::$$$message_0125_0000_0003$$$::All three of them greet me in different ways.[lr]::
16010::$$$message_0125_0000_0004$$$::...I feel like the degree of affection is gradually going down.::
16011::$$$message_0125_0001_0000$$$::"H-Hey, Miss Saegusa, Miss Himuro, and Makidera."[lr]::
16012::$$$message_0125_0001_0001$$$::"I-I'm the only one being called casually!?"[lr]::
16013::$$$message_0125_0001_0002$$$::It definitely wasn't intentional.[lr]::
16014::$$$message_0125_0001_0003$$$::It's just that "Miss Makidera" sounded too unnatural to come out of my mouth.::
16015::$$$message_0125_0002_0000$$$::"Hmm. Should I call you Maki then?"[lr]::
16016::$$$message_0125_0002_0001$$$::"Guh, g-[cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服04b(中) textoff=0]gross! Yukicchi is the only one who can call me that!"[lr]::
16017::$$$message_0125_0002_0002$$$::"Really? I think it's cute."[lr]::
16018::$$$message_0125_0002_0003$$$::"Unfortunately, it doesn't suit you to say that. You should endure being called casually, Makidera."::
16019::$$$message_0125_0003_0000$$$::The decision is made by Himuro, the adult, or more like a magistrate.::
16020::$$$message_0125_0004_0000$$$::"Dammit, I only see enemies around me for some reason. Is this my fate as a capable woman?[lr]::
16021::$$$message_0125_0004_0001$$$::But Emiya, what are you doing here?[lr]::
16022::$$$message_0125_0004_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01e(中),氷室私服02a(中),由紀香私服02c(中) textoff=0]That is...[lr]::
16023::$$$message_0125_0004_0003$$$::"W-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4]Why am I here!?"::
16024::$$$message_0125_0005_0000$$$::"That is also our line."[lr]::
16025::$$$message_0125_0005_0001$$$::"Could it be that you also like this kind of thing, Emiya?"[lr]::
16026::$$$message_0125_0005_0002$$$::Saegusa points to a fluffy stuffed toy.[lr]::
16027::$$$message_0125_0005_0003$$$::I've never even thought of whether I like or hate stuffed toys.[lr]::
16028::$$$message_0125_0005_0004$$$::As I look around my surroundings, Makidera is talking like she's clearly dissatisfied with my existence itself.::
16029::$$$message_0125_0006_0000$$$::"Could it be that you're secretly choosing a present for Tohsaka by yourself!?"[cacheimage storage=氷室私服02d(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02d(中) textoff=0][lr]::
16030::$$$message_0125_0006_0001$$$::"Oh, Tohsaka likes this sort of thing? [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服01f(中) textoff=0]Ahh..."::
16031::$$$message_0125_0007_0000$$$::"No, Emiya is making a face like we're off the mark."[lr]::
16032::$$$message_0125_0007_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01c(中),由紀香私服02c(中) textoff=0]Exactly. More than stuffed toys, jewels are more directly linked with Tohsaka's hobbies and profits.::
16033::$$$message_0125_0008_0000$$$::"No, it's not Tohsaka, but there's someone that I know that likes this kind of thing."[lr]::
16034::$$$message_0125_0008_0001$$$::"Oh okay, do you come here often, Emiya?"[lr]::
16035::$$$message_0125_0008_0002$$$::I nod, thinking that I have once before.[lr]::
16036::$$$message_0125_0008_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服02d(中) textoff=0]When I do, Makidera exclaims in an overexaggerated way.::
16037::$$$message_0125_0009_0000$$$::"You're quite diligent despite how you look."[lr]::
16038::$$$message_0125_0009_0001$$$::"How naïve, Makino-G. This secret good deed is his unexpected charm point. It's a charm that would appeal to wives."[lr]::
16039::$$$message_0125_0009_0002$$$::"Yeah, Emiya is a kind person."[lr]::
16040::$$$message_0125_0009_0003$$$::[font italic=true]...What kind of turn of events is this?[font italic=false][lr]::
16041::$$$message_0125_0009_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02a(中) textoff=0]And the pressure of being at a stuffed toy store also weighs on my shoulders.::
16042::$$$message_0125_0010_0000$$$::"Yukicchi, was there anything good today?"[lr]::
16043::$$$message_0125_0010_0001$$$::"Yeah, there was a kinda cute one, but maybe I'll get it next time..."[lr]::
16044::$$$message_0125_0010_0002$$$::"I see. Then why don't we go to the next one..."[lr]::
16045::$$$message_0125_0010_0003$$$::[clfg rule=シャッター左から time=400 pos=all]The three girls start walking.[lr]::
16046::$$$message_0125_0010_0004$$$::Good, I can run away here... I quickly escape from the store.::
16047::$$$message_0125_0011_0000$$$::I need to make sure I don't wander in here from now on.::
16048::$$$message_0125_0012_0000$$$::"Oh, this month's track and field magazine came out... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服01f(近)][wvl][chgfg storage=蒔寺私服01f(近) time=300 textoff=0]Oh, international track and field, and balance ball training."[lr]::
16049::$$$message_0125_0012_0001$$$::"So you actually check that too, huh, Makidera?"[lr]::
16050::$$$message_0125_0012_0002$$$::"It's only natural as an athlete... [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服01g(近)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01g(近) textoff=0]Why are you here?"::
16051::$$$message_0125_0013_0000$$$::I run into Makidera again at the same bookstore.[lr]::
16052::$$$message_0125_0013_0001$$$::...We happened to be going the same direction, so we ended up here inside Verde.[lr]::
16053::$$$message_0125_0013_0002$$$::We were miraculously side-by-side in the same magazine area.::
16054::$$$message_0125_0014_0000$$$::"Are you with Himuro and Saegusa again?"[lr]::
16055::$$$message_0125_0014_0001$$$::"Yukicchi is over there..."::
16056::$$$message_0125_0015_0000$$$::There certainly is Saegusa reading a rather thick comic magazine.[lr]::
16057::$$$message_0125_0015_0001$$$::She isn't reading thoroughly, but more like skimming through it.::
16058::$$$message_0125_0016_0000$$$::"Himuro is there. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01c(近) textoff=0]I wonder what she's reading.[lr]::
16059::$$$message_0125_0016_0001$$$::It's probably some psychology book or something."[lr]::
16060::$$$message_0125_0016_0002$$$::Himuro, on the other hand, is looking through the area with new books.::
16061::$$$message_0125_0017_0000$$$::"What did you come to look for?[lr]::
16062::$$$message_0125_0017_0001$$$::Oh, a kyudo book?"[lr]::
16063::$$$message_0125_0017_0002$$$::"...No, like DIY stuff or cooking magazines."[lr]::
16064::$$$message_0125_0017_0003$$$::"You're awfully domestic after all."[lr]::
16065::$$$message_0125_0017_0004$$$::Leave me alone.[lr]::
16066::$$$message_0125_0017_0005$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=300 pos=all]...Of course I used to read specialized magazines like Makidera before, but it didn't reach the point of having a subscription.::
16067::$$$message_0125_0018_0000$$$::"Ugh, Emiya, go away. You're distracting me."[lr]::
16068::$$$message_0125_0018_0001$$$::"That's mean. Anyway, I didn't mean to interrupt your book search."[lr]::
16069::$$$message_0125_0018_0002$$$::"...Coincidences do overlap. To think that Emiya and Makidera would meet again."::
16070::$$$message_0125_0019_0000$$$::Before I can leave, Himuro notices me. As I stop in my tracks since it's weird to leave right away, Saegusa also comes. [fg opacity=0 index=1000 time=100 left=183 top=71 storage=由紀香私服01a(中) textoff=0]::
16071::$$$message_0125_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, we're at the same place as Emiya again."[lr]::
16072::$$$message_0125_0020_0001$$$::"Heheh. It seems like this guy can't help but be curious about us."[lr]::
16073::$$$message_0125_0020_0002$$$::"Makino-G. By that logic, you're the number one candidate."[lr]::
16074::$$$message_0125_0020_0003$$$::Himuro makes a sharp remark.[lr]::
16075::$$$message_0125_0020_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中) textoff=0]Heheheh, what a bizarre joke.::
16076::$$$message_0125_0021_0000$$$::"What, you like Emiya, Maki!?"[lr]::
16077::$$$message_0125_0021_0001$$$::"It's the other way around! [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服03b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服03b(中) textoff=0]There's no way there would be such a hilarious situation!"[lr]::
16078::$$$message_0125_0021_0002$$$::"Say there is. Then Emiya, who approached Makidera first and foremost, would have a crush on her."[lr]::
16079::$$$message_0125_0021_0003$$$::[move time=350 path=(-72,38,255)(-65,31,255)(-100,39,255)(-94,30,255) storage=蒔寺私服01g(中) accel=0 textoff=0]That's really funny![wm canskip=0][lr]::
16080::$$$message_0125_0021_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服02a(中) textoff=0]But, Saegusa is blushing. She must not get the joke, being an innocent girl.::
16081::$$$message_0125_0022_0000$$$::"No! Negative zero chance! Look, Emiya's eyes are saying that there's no way! So much that beams might shoot out!"[lr]::
16082::$$$message_0125_0022_0001$$$::...First of all. Aren't you more Emiya's type, Kane?"[lr]::
16083::$$$message_0125_0022_0002$$$::"...Possibly.[lr]::
16084::$$$message_0125_0022_0003$$$::If so, you have good taste in women, Emiya."::
16085::$$$message_0125_0023_0000$$$::"Wait, r-really!?[lr]::
16086::$$$message_0125_0023_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=由紀香私服02c(中) time=300 textoff=0]I-It's not me, right...!?"[lr]::
16087::$$$message_0125_0023_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01g(中) textoff=0][r]::
16088::$$$message_0125_0023_0003$$$::It's hard to tell if she's relieved or flustered.::
16089::$$$message_0125_0024_0000$$$::"No, if you want to shoot the general, you must first shoot the horse. If he follows the proverb, then Emiya's aim might be you, Yukika."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
16090::$$$message_0125_0024_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16091::$$$message_0125_0024_0002$$$::"Am I the horse!? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=蒔寺私服04e(中) time=300 textoff=0]Emiya! If you make Yukika cry, I'll make you regret that you were born with any sensation of pain!"[lr]::
16092::$$$message_0125_0024_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02c(中) textoff=0]The three get heated up while I keep quiet.[lr]::
16093::$$$message_0125_0024_0004$$$::...I see. These three might be a well-balanced party.::
16094::$$$message_0125_0025_0000$$$::"But this must be a mere coincidence. [cacheimage storage=氷室私服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服01a(中) textoff=0]Look, Emiya looks like he's about to cry."[lr]::
16095::$$$message_0125_0025_0001$$$::"Y-Yeah, [cacheimage storage=由紀香私服01h(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=由紀香私服01h(中) time=300 textoff=0]ahaha..."[lr]::
16096::$$$message_0125_0025_0002$$$::"Ugh... Geez, you scared me to death."[lr]::
16097::$$$message_0125_0025_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 time=400 pos=all][lr]::
16098::$$$message_0125_0025_0004$$$::That's my line, but silence is golden.::
16099::$$$message_0125_0026_0000$$$::"...Ooh, so this frame is mainstream for long distance after all. I wonder if the lenses are laser red."[lr]::
16100::$$$message_0125_0026_0001$$$::"Oh, the sunglasses?"[lr]::
16101::$$$message_0125_0026_0002$$$::"I see, a lot of athletes at this level have them. Although they're inconvenient for me."::
16102::$$$message_0125_0027_0000$$$::The three of them are peering into the track and field magazine that Makidera is holding and each of them are talking.[lr]::
16103::$$$message_0125_0027_0001$$$::When I take a peek, I see various kinds of eyewear that the running athletes have on their eyes.::
16104::$$$message_0125_0028_0000$$$::"Yeah, since you have glasses, Kane."[lr]::
16105::$$$message_0125_0028_0001$$$::"I guess you would have to get prescription sunglasses...[cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服01e(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01e(中) textoff=0]those are expensive."[lr]::
16106::$$$message_0125_0028_0002$$$::Prescription sunglasses, huh? They must be expensive, especially if they're for sports.::
16107::$$$message_0125_0029_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 time=300 pos=all]I feel like track has technological advancements for tools, but kyudo is fixed in the past... But, it's not something that can be explained in one sentence. Both bows and carbon manufacturing are evolving.[lr]::
16108::$$$message_0125_0029_0001$$$::As I'm lost in thought, Saegusa says happily...::
16109::$$$message_0125_0030_0000$$$::"This would look good on you, Maki."[lr]::
16110::$$$message_0125_0030_0001$$$::"R-Really? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服03c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服03c(中) textoff=0]What do you think, Himuro?"[lr]::
16111::$$$message_0125_0030_0002$$$::"Hm, that's hard to say. [cacheimage storage=氷室私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02a(中) textoff=0]What about you, Emiya?"[lr]::
16112::$$$message_0125_0030_0003$$$::"Wait, me?"[lr]::
16113::$$$message_0125_0030_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01e(中),由紀香私服01a(中) textoff=0]Sunglasses on Makidera? Try to imagine it, that is...::
16114::$$$message_0125_0031_0000$$$::"...You would look just like a villainess from an American comic book."[lr]::
16115::$$$message_0125_0031_0001$$$::"......"[lr]::
16116::$$$message_0125_0031_0002$$$::It seems like that conclusion was too accurate.::
16117::$$$message_0125_0032_0000$$$::"R-Really? That means it's cool... Right?"[lr]::
16118::$$$message_0125_0032_0001$$$::"...I get what Emiya wants to say. You would naturally look evil if your eyes were hidden[line len=3]"[lr]::
16119::$$$message_0125_0032_0002$$$::"Khh! Why can't you just honestly say that I would look agile yet flexible and cool like a black panther!?"::
16120::$$$message_0125_0033_0000$$$::So Makidera wanted to be complimented.[lr]::
16121::$$$message_0125_0033_0001$$$::Oh, I thought she was just rough, but she has some cute moments too...I think?::
16122::$$$message_0125_0034_0000$$$::"...Well, it would look better on you than me."[lr]::
16123::$$$message_0125_0034_0001$$$::"Obviously. Imagine Emiya wearing these. If I'm a villainess, then this guy is a small-time crook."[lr]::
16124::$$$message_0125_0034_0002$$$::"What if you two were matching?"[lr]::
16125::$$$message_0125_0034_0003$$$::"...Probably a girl boss and her subordinate from a criminal organization."[lr]::
16126::$$$message_0125_0034_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01g(中) textoff=0][r]::
16127::$$$message_0125_0034_0005$$$::[font italic=true]...An underling?[font italic=false][lr]::
16128::$$$message_0125_0034_0006$$$::[font italic=true]Wait, this thing is my boss...?[font italic=false]::
16129::$$$message_0125_0035_0000$$$::"W-WAHHHHH!!!"[rf][lr]::
16130::$$$message_0125_0035_0001$$$::"Oops... I made them both cry..."[cacheimage storage=氷室私服02a(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 pos=c storage=氷室私服02a(中) textoff=0][lr]::
16131::$$$message_0125_0035_0002$$$::"I don't want a boss like this!"[lr]::
16132::$$$message_0125_0035_0003$$$::"I don't want a subordinate like this!"[lr]::
16133::$$$message_0125_0035_0004$$$::"...I guess colleagues was better..."[cacheimage storage=由紀香私服02c(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02c(中) textoff=0][lr]::
16134::$$$message_0125_0035_0005$$$::"I don't want that either!!!"[rf]::
916036::$$$message_9125_0008_0003$$$::When I do, Makidera exclaims in an overexaggerated way.[r]::

